<mxCell id="p0b20" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:18.0px&quot;&gt;적용&lt;br&gt;· ip load-sharing address source-destination port source-destination universal-id &amp;lt;계층별 값&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;· 같은 계층 안에서는 같은 값, 계층끼리만 다르게&lt;br&gt;· 5-tuple 유지 (SNAT 된 client 도 포트로 분산)&lt;br&gt;확인 : show ip load-sharing, 같은 계층 업링크 사용률 편차 ±10%&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EFE3C6;strokeColor=#D4A941;strokeWidth=2.5;fontColor=#201E1F;fontSize=13.0;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR,Noto Sans CJK KR,Malgun Gothic,Apple SD Gothic Neo,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="730" y="470" width="620" height="240" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
